"Measured on this Mac with sequential requests, as when typing. Each case keeps its category's app label, so a prompt is tested on every kind of text. Latency can differ by ~70 ms between runs (the system switches model modes). A full run takes about a minute; suggestions pause meanwhile." = "在這台 Mac 上以依序傳送的請求測量，與輸入時相同。每個案例都會保留其類別的 App 標籤，因此提示詞會在各種文字上接受測試。每次執行的延遲可能相差約 70 ms（系統會切換模型模式）。完整執行約需一分鐘，期間建議會暫停。";
"Saved versions" = "已儲存的版本";
