"next word %d%% (all)" = "下一個字詞 %d%%（全部）";
"corrected %d%%" = "已修正 %d%%";
"What the model is told to do, sent before every request. {words} becomes the number of words to suggest (General tab). Shorter instructions are faster: every token here costs time on each keystroke." = "告訴模型要做什麼，會在每個請求之前傳送。{words} 會替換成建議的字詞數量（「一般」標籤頁）。指示越短越快：這裡的每個 token 在每次按鍵時都會花費時間。";
"Sample inputs with the answer the model should give. The model copies their form closely: length, tone, and how a continuation starts. Each example adds to every request's time." = "範例輸入以及模型應給出的答案。模型會嚴格模仿它們的形式：長度、語氣以及接續內容的開頭方式。每多一個範例，每個請求的時間都會增加。";
"Runs the prompt on test cases and compares its answers with the expected ones, so you can see how a change to the prompt affects accuracy and speed before you rely on it." = "在測試案例上執行提示詞，並將其答案與預期答案比較，讓你在依賴它之前，就能看到提示詞的變更如何影響準確度和速度。";
"Example texts that come with Homeword (written for testing, no personal data), each cut at a point, with what was typed next. They cover chat, email, work documents, academic writing, code, general notes and terminal commands, plus 10 texts in each other language you write in, and results are shown per category. None of them is in a default prompt's examples. View… shows them." = "Homeword 隨附的範例文字（為測試而撰寫，不含個人資料），每段都在某處截斷，並附上接下來輸入的內容。涵蓋聊天、電子郵件、工作文件、學術寫作、程式碼、一般筆記和終端機指令，另外你使用的其他每種語言各有 10 段文字，結果會依類別顯示。它們都不在預設提示詞的範例中。按一下「檢視⋯」即可查看。";
"Sentences with known mistakes that come with Homeword, and their corrected versions. The prompt runs on each and its output is compared with the correction. View… shows them." = "Homeword 隨附的含已知錯誤的句子及其修正版本。提示詞會在每個句子上執行，並將輸出與修正版本比較。按一下「檢視⋯」即可查看。";
"Your own texts, as left = typed so far, right = what you would type next. They run as a separate section, so you can check a prompt on the kind of text you write. Stored on this Mac only." = "你自己的文字，左側 = 目前已輸入的內容，右側 = 接下來要輸入的內容。它們會作為獨立的區段執行，讓你可以用自己常寫的文字來檢驗提示詞。只會儲存在這台 Mac 上。";
"The last benchmark run of the prompt shown: your draft, your saved version, or the default. Small, noisy samples: a difference of one case is several percent." = "所顯示提示詞（你的草稿、你儲存的版本或預設值）的上一次基準測試結果。樣本少且有波動：相差一個案例就是好幾個百分點。";
"Every Save keeps a version (the last 20) with its benchmark result, if you ran one. Load one to edit or compare it." = "每次儲存都會保留一個版本（最近 20 個），若有執行基準測試，也會保留其結果。載入一個版本即可編輯或比較。";
"The kind of text: chat messages, email, work documents, academic writing, code comments and commits, general notes, terminal commands; and each other language you write in." = "文字的種類：聊天訊息、電子郵件、工作文件、學術寫作、程式碼註解和提交、一般筆記、終端機指令；以及你使用的其他每種語言。";
"All the built-in test cases together (your own cases are shown separately)." = "所有內建測試案例合計（你自己的案例會另外顯示）。";
"Your own test cases." = "你自己的測試案例。";
"How many texts ran in this row." = "這一列執行了多少段文字。";
"How often the first suggested word is exactly the word that was typed next (or the right end of an unfinished word). The main accuracy number." = "第一個建議的字詞與接下來輸入的字詞（或未完成字詞的正確剩餘部分）完全相同的頻率。這是主要的準確度指標。";
"How many suggested words in a row match what was typed, on average. Higher = more of a suggestion is worth accepting." = "平均有多少個連續的建議字詞與輸入的內容相符。越高 = 建議中值得接受的部分越多。";
"Of the texts that end mid-word, how often the suggestion finishes that word correctly." = "在以未完成字詞結尾的文字中，建議正確補全該字詞的頻率。";
"How often there was a suggestion at all (the model may answer with nothing usable)." = "有出現建議的頻率（模型可能給不出可用的答案）。";
"The median time from request to suggestion, in milliseconds: half of the suggestions came faster." = "從請求到出現建議的時間中位數，以毫秒為單位：一半的建議比這更快。";
"How often the output equals the corrected sentence exactly." = "輸出與修正後的句子完全相同的頻率。";
"How similar the output is to the corrected sentence, word by word (100% = identical)." = "輸出與修正後的句子逐字詞比較的相似程度（100% = 完全相同）。";
"The output's length divided by the input's. Around 1.0 keeps the length; much lower means text was dropped." = "輸出長度除以輸入長度。約 1.0 表示長度不變；明顯較低表示有文字被刪掉了。";
