"Read-only. Left: the text typed so far; right: what was typed next. A suggestion counts as right when it matches the right side." = "唯讀。左側：目前已輸入的文字；右側：接下來輸入的內容。建議與右側相符時算作正確。";
"Left out for this prompt (they share text with its examples): line %@" = "此提示詞已略過（與其範例有相同文字）：第 %@ 行";
