"Languages you write in" = "你使用的語言";
"Choose every language you type in, and only those. Homeword works out which of them you are typing and suggests in that language; a short list keeps it from mixing up similar languages (Danish and Norwegian, Spanish and Portuguese)." = "選擇你輸入時使用的所有語言，且只選這些語言。Homeword 會判斷你正在用其中哪一種語言輸入，並以該語言提供建議；列表簡短可避免混淆相似的語言（如丹麥文和挪威文、西班牙文和葡萄牙文）。";
