"Next to the cursor" = "游標旁邊";
"Words to suggest" = "建議的字詞數量";
"How many words a suggestion can have after the word you are typing. Every word costs model time on each suggestion (about 16 ms per token, ~1.2 tokens per word), and words further ahead are right less often. The model stops earlier at the end of a sentence, so the cost is a maximum." = "一個建議在你正在輸入的字詞之後最多可以包含多少個字詞。每個字詞都會增加每個建議的模型時間（每個 token 約 16 ms，每個字詞約 1.2 個 token），而且越後面的字詞正確率越低。模型在句尾會提早停止，因此這是最大耗時。";
"Start the engine to change this." = "啟動引擎後才能更改此項目。";
"Start suggesting after" = "開始建議的最少字元數";
"Add a space after a word taken with Tab" = "使用 Tab 接受字詞後加入空格";
"Suggest in apps whose text can't be read" = "在無法讀取文字的 App 中提供建議";
"Some apps draw their text themselves and don't share it (Google Docs, Figma, Sublime Text, games). There Homeword uses what you typed since your last click instead, kept in memory only. It starts after the first word, resets on clicks, arrows, Return and shortcuts, and is off while an input method is active. The pop-up shows where you last clicked." = "有些 App 會自行繪製文字且不分享（Google Docs、Figma、Sublime Text、遊戲）。在這些 App 中，Homeword 會改用你上次按一下後輸入的內容，這些內容只會保留在記憶體中。它會在輸入第一個字詞後開始，在按一下、按下方向鍵、Return 和快速鍵時重置，並在輸入法使用中時關閉。彈出式視窗會顯示在你上次按一下的位置。";
"Support Chrome-based browsers and Electron apps" = "支援以 Chrome 為基礎的瀏覽器和 Electron App";
"Tab inserts the highlighted word, Esc dismisses. Typing the suggestion's next letters keeps it. The writing style follows the app you type in (Apps tab)." = "按下 Tab 鍵插入反白的字詞，按 Esc 關閉。繼續輸入建議中接下來的字母，建議會保留。寫作風格會依你輸入時所用的 App 而定（「App」標籤頁）。";
"Languages" = "語言";
"Homeword's language" = "Homeword 的語言";
"System default" = "系統預設值";
"Homeword shows the new language after it restarts." = "Homeword 重新啟動後會顯示新語言。";
"Restart Homeword" = "重新啟動 Homeword";
"Suggestions come in the language you are typing, out of these. Homeword detects it as you type; listing only the languages you use makes that more accurate. Apple's on-device model supports these languages. By default: your system's language, or English if the model doesn't support it." = "建議會使用你正在輸入的語言（從以下語言中判斷）。Homeword 會在你輸入時偵測語言；只列出你使用的語言可以提高準確度。Apple 的裝置端模型支援這些語言。預設值：你的系統語言，若模型不支援則為英文。";
"Choose…" = "選擇⋯";
"The default: your system's language, or English. Add the other languages you write in." = "預設值：你的系統語言或英文。請加入你使用的其他語言。";
"Proofread and rewrite selected text" = "校對和重寫所選文字";
"Proofread selection" = "校對所選內容";
"Rewrite selection" = "重寫所選內容";
"Proofread fixes typos and grammar; rewrite makes the text clearer. Both keep your meaning. Return replaces the selection, ⌘C copies the result, Esc cancels." = "校對會修正錯字和文法；重寫會讓文字更清楚。兩者都會保留你的原意。按 Return 取代所選內容，按 ⌘C 拷貝結果，按 Esc 取消。";
"Homeword picks a writing style for the app you type in, and for web apps in browsers (Gmail is Email, Google Docs is Work documents). Change it per app here, or turn suggestions off for an app." = "Homeword 會為你輸入時所用的 App 以及瀏覽器中的網頁 App 選擇寫作風格（Gmail 為「電子郵件」，Google Docs 為「工作文件」）。你可以在這裡依 App 更改，或為某個 App 關閉建議。";
"Automatic (%@)" = "自動（%@）";
"Off" = "關閉";
"Choose an App…" = "選擇 App⋯";
"Add a running app, or choose one from Applications" = "加入正在執行的 App，或從「應用程式」中選擇";
