"Words accepted" = "接受的字詞";
"Keystrokes saved" = "節省的按鍵次數";
"%d of %d (%@)" = "%d / %d（%@）";
"Characters that accepted words typed for you (minus the Tab per word), out of all characters that went into the text while suggestions were on." = "接受的字詞替你輸入的字元數（扣除每個字詞的 Tab），佔建議開啟期間輸入文字的全部字元數的比例。";
